[3533]="70058AFB\n1\tDerrota a las Bestias de la Matanza\tLa trampa de Gorgar se ha activado, y ahora debes luchar en su arena o perecer. Debes derrotar a las Bestias de la Matanza de Gorgar.\n2\tDerrota a Gorgar y Ránulur\t¡Has derrotado a las bestias, pero Gorgar ahora tiene la intención de enfrentarse a ti en persona! ¡Ahora debes enfrentarte a Gorgar el Despiadado y a Ránulur, jefe de los huargos, en la arena!\n3\tCompletado: La conquista del Umbral sangriento (Nivel 5)\tHas completado Amdân Dammul, el Umbral sangriento -- Nivel 5.\n",
[3534]="70043E05\n1\tMata a los guardias enemigos en el puente de Ornendil (total: 10)\tEl puente de Ornendil se encuentra en el norte de Osgiliath sobre el río Anduin. Debes matar a los guardias enemigos en el puente de Ornendil.\n2\tEscucha los gritos de Shíktarb hacia ti\tShíktarb se encuentra en Shrak Mauruk. Deberías escuchar lo que te grita.\n",
[3535]="70056968\n1\tDerrota a Bratha Tasakh, Señora de los muchos venenos\tThe Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\n2\tDerrota Thossulun la Inmensa\tThossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.\n3\tDerrota a Rûkhor el Heraldo Pálido\tRûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!\n4\tDefeat Shelob\tThe last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 1)\tYou have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 1.\n",
[3536]="70056966\n1\tDerrota a Bratha Tasakh, Señora de los muchos venenos\tThe Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\n2\tDerrota Thossulun la Inmensa\tThossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all Grebyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harrassing your allies.\n3\tDerrota a Rûkhor el Heraldo Pálido\tRûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!\n4\tDefeat Shelob\tThe last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 2)\tYou have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 2.\n",
